From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shouryamaan Jain <jainshouryamaan@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 13:47:09 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(tui): add /invaders, Space Invaders in the bottom pane
 while Codex works

/invaders (or /space-invaders) opens the game in the bottom pane in place
of the composer, while the conversation keeps going above it and the
status line stays in view. The arrow keys, space and p belong to the
game; Esc or Ctrl-C closes it, and /invaders reopens it where it left
off, paused. Up to three shots in the air, an extra life every 1500
points, a mystery ship, and a field that fits the pane.

